WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.699
Thousands of Arabic manuscripts and documents can only be read

2
00:00:04.739 --> 00:00:05.161
by eye.

3
00:00:05.201 --> 00:00:07.910
Many of them are hard for most people to read,

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.222
and none of them can be searched.

5
00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:15.907
Therefore, we built Warraq, a system that turns old printed

6
00:00:15.947 --> 00:00:19.270
documents and manuscripts into fully editable,

7
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.780
searchable text.

8
00:00:22.186 --> 00:00:25.511
You upload your pages as PDF files or images,

9
00:00:25.551 --> 00:00:28.393
up to one hundred pages at a time.

10
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:32.579
Warraq reads the page line by line.

11
00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:35.476
It detects every line, extracts its text,

12
00:00:35.516 --> 00:00:39.574
and corrects its reading in the context of the whole page.

13
00:00:39.614 --> 00:00:44.244
This is a real reading of two pages from a manuscript in Islamic

14
00:00:44.284 --> 00:00:45.605
jurisprudence.

15
00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:51.101
Forty-four lines and five hundred and twenty-four words,

16
00:00:51.141 --> 00:00:53.949
read by Warraq in sixteen seconds.

17
00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:58.642
And Warraq is more than text extraction.

18
00:00:58.682 --> 00:01:00.902
It works on any type of document.

19
00:01:00.942 --> 00:01:03.854
It divides the page into headings, text,

20
00:01:03.894 --> 00:01:08.576
tables and images, and generates a structured text document that

21
00:01:08.616 --> 00:01:11.056
keeps the layout of the page.

22
00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:15.310
Warraq also takes a complete manuscript,

23
00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:16.756
with all its copies.

24
00:01:16.796 --> 00:01:21.159
It extracts the text of every copy, collates the copies and

25
00:01:21.199 --> 00:01:24.443
records the variants, references the verses,

26
00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:28.847
hadith and quotations, and produces the authenticated book,

27
00:01:28.887 --> 00:01:30.381
ready for print.

28
00:01:31.794 --> 00:01:34.520
Warraq reads governmental documents,

29
00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:38.975
old printed books, and manuscripts in Eastern and Maghribi

30
00:01:39.015 --> 00:01:39.930
scripts.

31
00:01:41.338 --> 00:01:45.510
It is the most accurate system for governmental documents and

32
00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:49.445
manuscripts, and it runs entirely on our servers in Saudi

33
00:01:49.485 --> 00:01:53.243
Arabia, without public tools or public language models.

34
00:01:53.283 --> 00:01:56.335
Your documents never leave the Kingdom.

35
00:01:57.746 --> 00:01:59.863
We work with you in two ways.

36
00:01:59.903 --> 00:02:04.053
We process your documents under a non-disclosure agreement and

37
00:02:04.093 --> 00:02:06.486
return complete, authenticated text.

38
00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:10.296
Or we give your organisation its own access to Warraq,

39
00:02:10.336 --> 00:02:13.953
customised to your documents and your workflow.

40
00:02:15.378 --> 00:02:17.722
Warraq, by EigenTech in Madinah.

41
00:02:17.762 --> 00:02:19.830
Try it now on our website.

